This makes low-fps full speed and physics stable. But at 15fps, 8 steps of 1/120 =.0667, exactly. Great. At 60fps 2 steps. At 120fps 1. Could be smoother. Debug __RR.step still works.

Implement fixed timestep 1/120 with max 8 steps. This also means normal gameplay deterministic. Use accumulator. Then update's dt=1/120. Jump etc fine. Camera update at 120Hz. Great.

Frame currently dt cap .05. Replace with accumulator. `frame.last` handling. Note on returning after tab hidden, dtMs huge -> clamp acc to .08. Good.

